          <P>Source: AUTOSAR_SWS_DiagnosticOverIP.pdf</P>
          <P>ECUCItemID: ECUC_DoIP_00006</P>
          <P>ParentContainer: DoIPGeneral</P>
          <P>Type: EcucFloatParamDef</P>
          <P>RangeOrReferenceTarget: ]0 .. INF[</P>
          <P>Multiplicity: 1</P>
          <P>DefaultValue: Post-Build Variant false</P>
          <P>PostBuildVariant: false</P>
          <P>Description: Determines the frequency at which the DoIP_MainFunction() is called in [s].</P>
          <P>Relationship: Not specified in source</P>
          <P>EvidenceClassification: Explicit</P>
          <P>SourceReference: 10.2.3 DoIPGeneral; PDF page 88 (printed page 88)</P>
        </ANNOTATION-TEXT>
      </ANNOTATION>
      <ANNOTATION>
        <LABELS>
          <L-4>DoIPMaxRequestBytes</L-4>
        </LABELS>
