      <ANNOTATION>
        <LABELS>
          <L-4>DoIPInterfaceActLineCtrl</L-4>
        </LABELS>
        <ANNOTATION-TEXT>
          <P>Source: AUTOSAR_SWS_DiagnosticOverIP.pdf</P>
          <P>ECUCItemID: ECUC_DoIP_00101</P>
          <P>ParentContainer: DoIPInterface</P>
          <P>Type: EcucBooleanParamDef</P>
          <P>RangeOrReferenceTarget: Not specified in source</P>
          <P>Multiplicity: 1</P>
          <P>DefaultValue: Post-Build Variant false</P>
          <P>PostBuildVariant: false</P>
          <P>Description: This attribute defines whether the network interface • is started "on-demand" when an activation line is sensed (TRUE) or • is always available (FALSE).</P>
          <P>Relationship: Not specified in source</P>
          <P>EvidenceClassification: Explicit</P>
          <P>SourceReference: 10.2.9 DoIPInterface; PDF page 101 (printed page 101)</P>
        </ANNOTATION-TEXT>
      </ANNOTATION>
      <ANNOTATION>
        <LABELS>
          <L-4>DoIPInterfaceAnnouncementStart</L-4>
        </LABELS>
        <ANNOTATION-TEXT>
          <P>Source: AUTOSAR_SWS_DiagnosticOverIP.pdf</P>
          <P>ECUCItemID: ECUC_DoIP_00099</P>
          <P>ParentContainer: DoIPInterface</P>
          <P>Type: EcucEnumerationParamDef</P>
          <P>RangeOrReferenceTarget: DOIP_AUTOMATIC_ANN AUTOMATIC announcement</P>
          <P>Multiplicity: 1</P>
          <P>DefaultValue: DOIP_AUTOMATIC_ANNOUNCE</P>
          <P>PostBuildVariant: false</P>
          <P>Description: This attribute defines, when vehicle announcement is started on a DoIPInterface • Automatic: As soon as the underlying UDP vehicle announcement connection switches to SOAD_SOCON_ONLINE • OnTrigger: As soon as the API DoIP_TriggerVehicleAnnouncement is called for the given DoIPInterface instance</P>
          <P>Relationship: Not specified in source</P>
          <P>EvidenceClassification: Explicit</P>
          <P>SourceReference: 10.2.9 DoIPInterface; PDF page 101 (printed page 101)</P>
        </ANNOTATION-TEXT>
      </ANNOTATION>
      <ANNOTATION>
        <LABELS>
          <L-4>DoIPInterfaceId</L-4>
        </LABELS>
        <ANNOTATION-TEXT>
          <P>Source: AUTOSAR_SWS_DiagnosticOverIP.pdf</P>
          <P>ECUCItemID: ECUC_DoIP_00098</P>
          <P>ParentContainer: DoIPInterface</P>
          <P>Type: EcucIntegerParamDef (Symbolic Name generated for this parameter)</P>
          <P>RangeOrReferenceTarget: 0 .. 255</P>
          <P>Multiplicity: 1</P>
          <P>DefaultValue: Post-Build Variant false</P>
          <P>PostBuildVariant: false</P>
          <P>Description: This parameter is an identifier of the DoIPInterface. The value of this parameter will be assigned to the symbolic name derived from the container short name.</P>
          <P>Relationship: Not specified in source</P>
          <P>EvidenceClassification: Explicit</P>
          <P>SourceReference: 10.2.9 DoIPInterface; PDF page 102 (printed page 102)</P>
        </ANNOTATION-TEXT>
      </ANNOTATION>
