          <P>RangeOrReferenceTarget: Not specified in source</P>
          <P>Multiplicity: 1</P>
          <P>DefaultValue: Post-Build Variant false</P>
          <P>PostBuildVariant: false</P>
          <P>Description: Provided the information if a configured EID at vehicle identification response/vehicle announment is used or the MAC address. TRUE: Use MAC Address instead of EID for Vehicle identification/announcement. FALSE: Use configured EID for vehicle identification/announcement. Dependencies: DoIPEID</P>
          <P>Relationship: Not specified in source</P>
          <P>EvidenceClassification: Explicit</P>
          <P>SourceReference: 10.2.9 DoIPInterface; PDF page 102 (printed page 102)</P>
        </ANNOTATION-TEXT>
