      <ANNOTATION>
        <LABELS>
          <L-4>DoIPRoutingActivation</L-4>
        </LABELS>
        <ANNOTATION-TEXT>
          <P>Source: AUTOSAR_SWS_DiagnosticOverIP.pdf</P>
          <P>ECUCItemID: ECUC_DoIP_00030</P>
          <P>ParentContainer: DoIPInterface</P>
          <P>Type: EcucParamConfContainerDef</P>
          <P>RangeOrReferenceTarget: Not specified in source</P>
          <P>Multiplicity: 0..255</P>
          <P>DefaultValue: Not specified in source</P>
          <P>PostBuildVariant: false</P>
          <P>Description: This container describes the routing activation possibilities by representing for each container a possible routing activation request message to the DoIP entity and the according references to the activated diagnostic messages.</P>
          <P>Relationship: Contains DoIPRoutingActivationNumber, DoIPTargetAddressRef, and DoIPRoutingActivationSecurityRequired. Includes DoIPRoutingActivationAuthenticationCallback and DoIPRoutingActivationConfirmationCallback.</P>
          <P>EvidenceClassification: Explicit</P>
          <P>SourceReference: 10.2.23 DoIPRoutingActivation; PDF page 119 (printed page 119)</P>
        </ANNOTATION-TEXT>
    </ANNOTATION>
      <ANNOTATION>
