          <P>Description: Container contains all lower layer connection specific information, i.e. the single Pdu References and Handle IDs to the SoAd.</P>
          <P>Relationship: Contains DoIPTargetAddress, DoIPTcpConnection, DoIPUdpConnection, and DoIPUdpVehicleAnnouncementConnection.</P>
